## Project: Algorithm Arena

A web app comparing 5 classical ML models (Logistic Regression, KNN, SVM, Decision Tree, Naive Bayes) on the same tabular dataset. The purpose is to visualize trade-offs (speed vs. accuracy vs. model size), not just show one accuracy number.

