## Key Technical Facts

- **Backend:** FastAPI (Python 3.11+), Uvicorn, Pydantic v2
- **ML:** scikit-learn ≥1.3, pandas, numpy, joblib
- **Frontend:** Vanilla HTML/CSS/JS (check `decisions.md` — this may change)
- **API Prefix:** `/api/v1`
- **Key Endpoints:** `POST /predict`, `GET /metrics`, `GET /form-schema`, `GET /health`
- **Serialization:** joblib `.pkl` files in `model_training/artifacts/`
- **CRITICAL RULE:** Never refit transformers (scaler/encoder) on live input at inference time.

